  "description": "Crest Petal Split Monogram – Elegant Floral Split Monogram Font\nCrest Petal Split Monogram is a graceful serif font with split-letter styling and floral embellishments, perfect for crafting personalized crests, name signs, and upscale event designs. Each uppercase letter features a delicate botanical flourish and a clean center split, making it ideal for inserting names or custom text. This monogram font brings refined charm to weddings, boutique branding, and luxurious gifting.\nFeatures:\nSplit Monogram Style: Classic uppercase letters divided by a clean horizontal line for customization.\nFloral Accents: Petal-inspired botanical elements wrap around each letter for an artistic, organic touch.\nReady for Personalization: Perfect for monograms, signage, and engraved-style gifts.\nIdeal For: Wedding signage, personalized gifts, Cricut projects, custom logos, branding, and floral-themed decor.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Crest Petal Split Monogram – Elegant Floral Split Monogram Font</p>\n<p>Crest Petal Split Monogram is a graceful serif font with split-letter styling and floral embellishments, perfect for crafting personalized crests, name signs, and upscale event designs. Each uppercase letter features a delicate botanical flourish and a clean center split, making it ideal for inserting names or custom text. This monogram font brings refined charm to weddings, boutique branding, and luxurious gifting.</p>\n<p>Features:</p>\n<p>Split Monogram Style: Classic uppercase letters divided by a clean horizontal line for customization.<br>\nFloral Accents: Petal-inspired botanical elements wrap around each letter for an artistic, organic touch.<br>\nReady for Personalization: Perfect for monograms, signage, and engraved-style gifts.<br>\nIdeal For: Wedding signage, personalized gifts, Cricut projects, custom logos, branding, and floral-themed decor.</p>",
